# Chatterbox model version pin.
#
# Format: <variant>@<revision>
#   variant  : ONNX quantization variant  (fp32 | fp16 | q4 | q4f16 | quantized)
#   revision : Hugging Face repo revision (a commit hash, tag, or "main")
#
# Variants (per component — language_model / embed_tokens / conditional_decoder):
#   fp32       default, largest  (~2.3 GB total)   highest quality
#   fp16       half precision    (~1.1 GB total)   default: desktop-friendly
#   q4         int4 weights, fp32 activations  (~470 MB)
#   q4f16      int4 weights, fp16 activations  (~380 MB)   mobile-targeted
#   quantized  int8 all          (~760 MB)
#
# The setup script accepts a -Variant command-line arg that overrides the
# variant here (useful for pulling both fp16 for desktop tests and q4f16
# for mobile validation without bumping the pinned default).
#
# Revision: leave as "main" for development; pin to a specific commit
# hash for reproducible builds. Bump whenever upstream publishes a
# quality / compatibility change and we've validated it.

fp16@main
